            "review_title": "Review at Infinity Bar",
            "review_text": "Tegan P\n19 contributions\n0\nGreat pool and cocktails\nNov 2016 • Family\nWe came up each afternoon for a refreshing swim and a cocktail. The staff were friendly and attentive. The drinks were well made and tasty. Has a nice atmosphere and great music selection to relax to.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 1, 2016\nClimber659568\nThank you Tegan!\nWe are glad to know you have enjoyed Infinity. Will share your review with the team, as I am sure they will appreciate it.\nLooking forward to welcome you back soon!\n\nInfinity Rooftop Bar\nRead more\nWritten December 28, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
